Useful spoiler ahead for those that want to die young or find the Wiz....


You have to level teleport, using a ring of teleport control and either:

A) A level teleport trap found in the dungeon somewhere

B) Reading a scroll of Teleport while confused.

You need the ring so that the game will allow you to type in the level you
wish to go to, otherwise the level you go to is random.  Make sure you 
teleport far enough down into the dungeon, because you can only go up
after you reach Hell/minotaur's maze.  Remember that Hell is hot, so you
better be able to take the heat.


